{"timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:23:36.797Z","ordinal":358,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a19f38-1b5c-79f2-b052-0d79a75bc8ed","role":"developer","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"<tools>\nAdded deferred tool namespaces:\n- mcp__codex_app: Manage the Codex desktop app: find, create, and update chats; organize projects, sidebar, and pinned items; schedule automations; manage worktrees; open app panels; and locate bundled libraries for documents, spreadsheets, slides, and PDFs.\n- mcp__codex_apps__sites: Use Sites to build or modify websites, including landing pages, portfolios, dashboards, portals, trackers, hubs, and internal tools. For repository-based sites, use Sites skills for local implementation, source preparation, and artifact packaging....\n</tools>"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19f38-19fd-7e20-8f50-95fe2c95a706","create_time":1793672616.7963731,"content_item_kinds":["tools.deferred_namespaces"],"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"tool_search"}}]}}}
